        "explanation_ar": "healthy صفة (صحي)، و healthier صيغة المقارنة (أكثر صحة). y تتحول إلى i ثم نضيف er.",
        "explanation_en": "\"Healthy\" → \"healthier\" (y changes to i + er).",
        "examples": [
          {
            "word": "healthy",
            "sentence": "Fruit is healthy."
          },
          {
            "word": "healthier",
            "sentence": "I want to be healthier."
          }
        ]
      },
